        "notes": "Probed 2026-11-24 on the owner's NVIDIA catalog: of 7 embedding models listed, only nemotron-3.5-embed-1b (2048 native) and nemotron-3.5-embed-8b (4096 native) answered; embed-qa-4, nv-embedqa-1b-v1, nemoretriever-1b-vlm, nv-embedqa-mistral-7b-v2 and arctic-embed-l returned 404. nemotron-3.5-embed-1b honours dimensions: 1024 (Matryoshka), matching vector(1024); batch of 32 accepted; about 0.3 s per call. Evaluation-only terms: owner runs only. The keyless chain has no embedding provider, so public-demo retrieval is full-text only (ADR 0008)."
